## 명시적 잠금 (Explicit Locking)

### SELECT FOR UPDATE 계열

```sql
-- 1) 기본 FOR UPDATE: 해당 행에 배타적 잠금 (다른 FOR UPDATE / UPDATE / DELETE 블로킹)
SELECT * FROM products WHERE id = 1 FOR UPDATE;

-- 2) FOR UPDATE NOWAIT: 잠금을 즉시 획득할 수 없으면 에러 발생
SELECT * FROM products WHERE id = 1 FOR UPDATE NOWAIT;
-- ERROR: could not obtain lock on row in relation "products"

-- 3) FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED: 이미 잠긴 행을 건너뜀 (Job Queue 패턴의 핵심)
SELECT * FROM job_queue
WHERE status = 'pending'
ORDER BY created_at
LIMIT 1
FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED;

-- 4) FOR SHARE: 공유 잠금 (다른 FOR SHARE는 허용, FOR UPDATE / UPDATE / DELETE 블로킹)
SELECT * FROM products WHERE id = 1 FOR SHARE;

-- 5) FOR KEY SHARE: FK 참조 무결성 확인용 (가장 약한 잠금)
SELECT * FROM orders WHERE product_id = 1 FOR KEY SHARE;
```

### 잠금 모드 호환성

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "잠금 호환성 매트릭스"
        A["FOR KEY SHARE"] -->|호환| B["FOR SHARE"]
        B -->|호환| C["FOR NO KEY UPDATE"]
        A -->|호환| C
        C -->|충돌| D["FOR UPDATE"]
        B -->|충돌| D
        D -->|충돌| D
    end
```

| 요청 \ 보유 | FOR KEY SHARE | FOR SHARE | FOR NO KEY UPDATE | FOR UPDATE |
|------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
| FOR KEY SHARE | O | O | O | X |
| FOR SHARE | O | O | X | X |
| FOR NO KEY UPDATE | O | X | X | X |
| FOR UPDATE | X | X | X | X |

