## SKIP LOCKED Job Queue 패턴

### 테이블 설계

```sql
CREATE TABLE job_queue (
    id          BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    job_type    VARCHAR(50)  NOT NULL,
    payload     JSONB        NOT NULL,
    status      VARCHAR(20)  NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending',
    created_at  TIMESTAMPTZ  NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
    started_at  TIMESTAMPTZ,
    completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    worker_id   VARCHAR(100)
);

CREATE INDEX idx_job_queue_pending ON job_queue (created_at)
    WHERE status = 'pending';
```

### Kotlin JdbcTemplate 구현

```kotlin
@Service
class JobQueueWorker(
    private val jdbcTemplate: JdbcTemplate,
    private val transactionTemplate: TransactionTemplate
) {
    private val workerId = "${InetAddress.getLocalHost().hostName}-${ProcessHandle.current().pid()}"

    fun pollAndProcess(): Boolean {
        return transactionTemplate.execute { _ ->
            // 1) 대기 중인 작업 1건을 가져오면서 잠금 (이미 잠긴 행은 건너뜀)
            val job = jdbcTemplate.query("""
                SELECT id, job_type, payload
                FROM job_queue
                WHERE status = 'pending'
                ORDER BY created_at
                LIMIT 1
                FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
            """.trimIndent()) { rs, _ ->
                JobRecord(
                    id = rs.getLong("id"),
                    jobType = rs.getString("job_type"),
                    payload = rs.getString("payload")
                )
            }.firstOrNull() ?: return@execute false

            // 2) 상태를 processing으로 변경
            jdbcTemplate.update("""
                UPDATE job_queue
                SET status = 'processing', started_at = now(), worker_id = ?
                WHERE id = ?
            """.trimIndent(), workerId, job.id)

            // 3) 실제 작업 수행
            try {
                processJob(job)
                jdbcTemplate.update("""
                    UPDATE job_queue
                    SET status = 'completed', completed_at = now()
                    WHERE id = ?
                """.trimIndent(), job.id)
            } catch (e: Exception) {
                jdbcTemplate.update("""
                    UPDATE job_queue
                    SET status = 'failed', completed_at = now()
                    WHERE id = ?
                """.trimIndent(), job.id)
                throw e
            }
            true
        } ?: false
    }

    private fun processJob(job: JobRecord) {
        // 작업 유형별 처리 로직
        when (job.jobType) {
            "email" -> sendEmail(job.payload)
            "report" -> generateReport(job.payload)
            else -> throw IllegalArgumentException("Unknown job type: ${job.jobType}")
        }
    }
}
```

> [!tip] SKIP LOCKED vs 외부 메시지 큐
> - **SKIP LOCKED**: 별도 인프라 불필요, 트랜잭션 보장, 소규모~중규모 처리량에 적합
> - **Kafka/RabbitMQ**: 대규모 처리량, 다중 컨슈머 그룹, 이벤트 재생 필요 시 적합
> - 작업 건수가 초당 수백 건 이하라면 SKIP LOCKED로 충분한 경우가 많다

